WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.200
What a remediation can and cannot establish.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.301
Z.ai's response to the ZCode snapshot reports, piece by piece.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.811
The response, unusually complete.

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.950
Remediated in v3.14.0, feature removed.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.089
Client source opened under Apache-2.0.

00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:20.600
Two third-party assessments published.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:26.226
2 commits in the published repository: the remediated tree, not its history.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:32.494
17 outbound-request scenarios in the vendor's own list, none a snapshot upload.

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:37.543
"No functional path identified" is a bounded negative, not a proof.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.858
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
